		"description": "<p>Also at 2nd level, you begin to pick up a variety of developed talents to help you make your way. At 2nd level, you gain a warrior's forte of your choice. Your warrior's forte options are detailed at the end of the champion class entry and you gain additional choices as you gain levels, as shown by the class table.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.5iCB9hMG8fK2f0qT]{Maximal Effort}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.H5f5NX96gmdzhcAr]{Single Minded Drive}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.6buDg6EAaCllFIKs]{Knight and Squire}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.hSwij9Gv7UJhoj9c]{Knight-Errant}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.vBFgb2YCYOnRb3L5]{Ascetic Journey}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.txhuhKcS7LUMFufz]{Common Burdens}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.ccWYKgt1RAtIYqP7]{Courtly Taster}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.OXKrpt4GMOJtpgzO]{Iron Will}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.vGfUAR6OmwSRu6Dv]{Rough Traveler}</p>",
